From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:02:08 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] update vendor kernel through 4.14.213 (devices/fossil-hoki)

Apply the 4.14.207 stable update and the later 4.14.212 and 4.14.213 increments to the vendor kernel. The checked-in patch-of-patch files drop the hunks already superseded by the vendor tree, including the f_fs.c, ufshcd.c and smp2p.c diffs in 4.14.213. The 4.14.213 kernel and hoki DTBs build successfully.
